    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This red curry is built on "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "red curry paste",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "red-curry-paste"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " fried in hot oil until fragrant, then loosened with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "coconut milk ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "coconut-milk"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The vegetables go in at different times so nothing overcooks. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For a vegan version, swap the fish sauce for soy sauce and use a vegan red curry paste."
          }
        ]
      },
